---
id: greet
harpoon: "1.0"
name: Greeting Generator
description: Generates a friendly greeting

# Prompt-first workflow fields
entrypoint: true

input:
  name:
    type: string
    required: true
    description: The name to greet

output:
  format: text
---
Generate a warm, friendly greeting for {{ name }}.

Keep it to one sentence.
